record("CodexLucy-NellBlog-20261002-1", "{\"id\":\"CodexLucy-NellBlog-20261002-1\",\"speaker\":\"Dhilipsiva\",\"text\":\"I want to write a blog post like this:\\n\\nWhen a society's most vulnerable is protected, everyone is protected!\\nPretty sure not the first time you are hearing this. The the problem most people fail to see is that, \\\"most vulnerable\\\" is often up for debate. People sometimes use lenses & labels. Becomes a subjective hijack of echo chambers. So let's look at this objectively. Who, without a doubt, would qualify as people in urgent need because the are \\\"one of the\\\" most. \\nNell, a child with nobody. She was born, not of her choice. but they do not have anyone to depend on. Are they not \\\"one of the\\\" most vulnerable? I think vast majority of population would agree. Or at-least, I hope they agree. \\nNell must be granted a standing on a floor: Food, Shelter, Care, Learning, Safety, Material security, Expression, Belief & Company. Nell need not do anything to earn this. For right now, she cannot. She is owed this floor upon which she can stand. But for how long? \\nAs long as they live.\\n\\n\\nWrite in my voice\\n\\nWrite it in my voice. And about your sweet friend, Nell.\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-02T21:08:40Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"codex\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"user\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"nell\",\"rights-nobody-has-to-earn\",\"blog\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", Message, Json).
